Z||000000||Standard||07-14-2001||01:14 AM||||The Pontiac/Oakland Club International convention is going to be at Treasure Island next week, 18-21.  And they actually know what a Fiero is!  Some pics of Fiero's at last years convention:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.poci.org/2000convention/images/large/74.jpg"> <P>ok so they only had one pic that worked..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>But I'd like to cruise out there thursday/friday since I have those days off next week.  Anyone in?<P>I'd also like to show up at one of the <A HREF="http://www.modernmuscleofmn.com" TARGET=_blank>Modern Muscle of Minnesota</A> meetings, even though I know my car isn't quite the type they're used to, I'm sure..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">        <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||4
