Z||000004||Standard||07-15-2001||02:35 AM||||Talkin to Gary, he said that this year you have to be a member of POCI to show your car.  So that would be $35 on top of the $30 registration.. so I'm thinkin' if I go I'll just go look at all the cars, and not enter my car.<P>Sorry about losing ya Jaei!  We pulled off by Porkies and watched ya drive by  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Calhoun turned out great tho!  It was cool meeting everyone.||||reg||1
